<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 2 Best in Slot Gear list for Feral Druid Tank in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Ulduar, Naxxramas, Obsidian Sanctum, and Eye of Eternity. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Feral Druid Tank Phase 2</h2>Just as in Phase 1, item level remains the single most impactful attribute on any piece of tanking gear in Phase 2, as it directly determines the total allocation of useful survivability and Threat stats on each item. This means that you can continue to use item level as an excellent proxy for tanking value when evaluating potential upgrades for your bear in Phase 2. The highest item level that is attainable from Phase 2 raid drops is 252 (from 25-man Hard Mode bosses in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a>), and unsurprisingly, the embedded BiS setups below use a 252 item level piece in nearly every slot where one is available.<br/>
<br/>The first gear set shown just below is a balanced configuration that is appropriate for tanking the large majority of bosses in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a>:<br/>
