<span class="tinyicontxt">Yogg-Saron</span></a> (25). These legs are expected to be one of the most contested drops in the entire phase, but fortunately, the best runner up options for bears, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45846/leggings-of-wavering-shadow">
