<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Feral Druid Tank Phase 2</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Feral Druid Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45517/pendulum-of-infinity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendulum of Infinity</span></a> is the highest value necklace for bears in Phase 2 despite being itemized for DPS. This is because the only 252 Item Level "pure tanking" option, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45485/bronze-pendant-of-the-vanir">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bronze Pendant of the Vanir</span></a>, unfortunately wastes a lot of its stat budget on Parry Rating, which is useless for Feral tanks. Nevertheless, it is worth picking up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45485/bronze-pendant-of-the-vanir">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bronze Pendant of the Vanir</span></a> anyway after your co-tank gets theirs, as it is still the best pure survival option against scary bosses like <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32871/algalon-the-observer">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Algalon the Observer</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
