<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Feral Druid Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45471/fates-clutch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fate's Clutch</span></a> is by far the single best tanking ring for Feral Druids in Phase 2 due to its excellent mix of mitigation and Threat stats, and it should be permanently equipped in any tanking scenario. The second ring slot is more flexible: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45608/branns-signet-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_67.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brann's Signet Ring</span></a> will be the highest value choice for most encounters, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45112/the-leviathans-coil">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Leviathan's Coil</span></a> is an efficient swap when gearing for maximum survivability.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59636/enchant-ring-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Stamina</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=333/enchanting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchanting</span></a>. <br/>Only Enchanters may apply ring enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
