<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Feral Druid Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> finally introduces two new tanking trinkets that will outperform the pre-raid options that were used throughout Phase 1: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45158/heart-of-iron">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Iron</span></a> off <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33118/ignis-the-furnace-master">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ignis the Furnace Master</span></a> (25) and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46021/royal-seal-of-king-llane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Seal of King Llane</span></a> off <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33288/yogg-saron">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Yogg-Saron</span></a> (10). While <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45158/heart-of-iron">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Iron</span></a> is clearly the better of the two for Feral tanks, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46021/royal-seal-of-king-llane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Seal of King Llane</span></a> is still a massive upgrade over all alternatives despite its on-use effect providing no value to bears (who cannot parry). In fact, simulations indicate that Feral tanks will actually benefit <i>more</i> from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46021/royal-seal-of-king-llane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Seal of King Llane</span></a> than the other three tank specs despite their inability to parry, simply due to the spec's intrinsically superior scaling with Stamina.<br/>
<br/>Unfortunately, the two other tank-itemized trinkets that drop in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45313/furnace-stone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_59.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Furnace Stone</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45507/the-generals-heart">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The General's Heart</span></a>, are extremely mediocre for bears and are outclassed even by the Phase 1 pre-raid trinkets in simulations of tank survival on the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32871/algalon-the-observer">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Algalon the Observer</span></a> encounter.<div class="pad"></div>
