<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="idols-for-feral-druid-tank-phase-2">Idols for Feral Druid Tank Phase 2</h4>In Phase 2, Feral tanks will finally be able to replace <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38365/idol-of-perspicacious-attacks">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/classic_ability_druid_demoralizingroar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Perspicacious Attacks</span></a> with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45509/idol-of-the-corruptor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Corruptor</span></a>, which drops from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33271/general-vezax">
<span class="tinyicontxt">General Vezax</span></a> (25). Unlike its TBC counterpart <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=33509/idol-of-terror">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/classic_ability_druid_demoralizingroar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Terror</span></a>, whose <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=43738/primal-instinct">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_blessingofagility.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primal Instinct</span></a> buff was limited in uptime due to a 10 second internal cooldown on the proc, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45509/idol-of-the-corruptor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Corruptor</span></a> has no ICD and can refresh itself indefinitely, resulting in very high average uptime for the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64951/primal-wrath">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_blessingofagility.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primal Wrath</span></a> buff. As a result, this Idol should be permanently equipped in pretty much any tanking scenario in Phase 2.<div class="pad"></div>
